  "body": "I thought it might be worth collecting together the reports we've seen about problems people are having with the password-reset-email feature when they upgrade to Synapse 1.0, so that we can decide what to do about them.\r\n\r\n* ~~Docker image doesn't start: #5430~~\r\n* ~~More generally, anyone who has set `email` but not `public_baseurl` will find synapse doesn't start~~\r\n* ~~Anyone using a custom `templates_dir` (and has `email` set) will find synapse doesn't start (fixed by https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/pull/5543)~~\r\n* ~~You now need to `pip install jinja2`: #5431~~\r\n* ~~Poor logging: #5485~~ \r\n* ~~Requires a template even when disabled: #5496 (?)~~",
